"His soul is merged into the core of Blightbane as bait to trap the Crimson Blight."
"He fights the blight's core inside the blade for centuries, alone."
"He masters several dozen sword schools and holds the Concept Defender of the Realm."
"His Concept blends martial skill, battlefield leadership and civil engineering."
"He is near the peak of Tier 2 and works toward an inner world."
"Merging with the blade costs him all vital energy, so he uses no skills or mana outside it."
"He can manifest in the physical world for five minutes a day, wielding the blade himself."
"If his manifestation is destroyed he suffers no harm but must sleep most of the day."
"He speaks aloud and senses the world through a linked crystal assistant construct."
"His first words to his bearer are: You're welcome."
"If his bearer dies without handing the blade on, he may be trapped for millennia."
"Descendants of surviving Kastillans live somewhere in the multiverse."
"He does not fight dreadbeasts in person, since their drain could harm his soul."
